{"code": 1, "data": {"content": "<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;马来西亚，我们来啦！&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">近日，100名京东一线兄弟姐妹落地吉隆坡，开启了为期一周的&ldquo;一线楷模出国游&rdquo;。自2013年启动以来，一线楷模的足迹已经走过马尔代夫、迪拜、巴厘岛、新加坡等国家和地区，今年，出国游的队伍更是迎来了外卖骑手等新的家人，他们在各自岗位上用勤劳的双手传递美好，也在京东收获了不少&ldquo;人生第一次&rdquo;的瞬间。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1757471716469.jpg\" /></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;自从被评上<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">京东物流</a>十大感动人物，</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">父母眼里我不再只是个接打电话的了！&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">京东物流客服范延龙扎根岗位5年</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">每年2.7万多通服务电话，连续3年拿A</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">但他说最暖的还是邵大妈被那句</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\"> &ldquo;多亏你，养老金保住了&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;在京东有很多第一次，第一次收到客户锦旗</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">第一次在千人大礼堂上领奖</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">这是人生第一次出国玩。&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1757471766496.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-size: 14px;\"><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">△范延龙工作中</span><span style=\"font-family: 微软雅黑;\">与马六甲海峡游玩</span></span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;我从小长在黄河边</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">这是我第一次去看海&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在内蒙古巴彦淖尔，<a style=\"color: #000000;\" href=\"/express\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">京东快递</a>员杜龙</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">一个人一辆车三年跑了16万公里</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他不仅把货送进村送上门</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">还总喜欢&ldquo;搭把手&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">买药、换灯泡、贴春联&hellip;&hellip;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他成了全村几十户老人的&ldquo;专属代购&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">知道他要出远门</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">老人们见到他就得念叨声&ldquo;注意安全&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1757471848555.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">△杜龙领取证书与在马努干岛海滩边</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;出发前的几天，</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">女儿见面就跟人说&lsquo;我爸爸在京东工作</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">公司还请他免费出国游玩呢&rsquo;！&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">贵州黔东南的侗族快递员周有四在京东干了快9年</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">连续两年绩效A+，是站点公认的&ldquo;揽收王&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">还被评为&ldquo;最美天柱人&rdquo;&ldquo;2024年贵州好人&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;我是村里第一个出国旅游的</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">除了吃好喝好</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">更想跟京东各业务线的精英们学学好的经验！&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5;\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1757471915992.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">△周有四工作中与在马来西亚游玩</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;自从得知公司奖励我免费出国游玩，</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">老婆就给我列了一长串海外购清单&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">80后京东物流广州车队司机张小平</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">握着16米5大货车的方向盘7年了</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">至今保持零违章零事故</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">还拿过全国驾驶员技能大赛冠军</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;长这么大第一次出国</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">还是跟公司里业务最出色的99个人一起</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">这一趟值了！&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1757471971616.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">△张小平在马努干岛海滩边</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;我天天在仓库里忙活儿</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">与叉车、传送带、扫描枪打交道</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">想不到这次出国游有我一个！&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">说起这份意外之喜</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在京东物流坚守6年的叉车司机薛玉良眼里满是笑意。</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">6年间七次拿下大促&ldquo;兵王&rdquo;称号</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他手把手带出60多名新人</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">拿到 &ldquo;省区优秀导师&rdquo; </span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;公司给的出国机会，更多是一份认可，</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">告诉我们&lsquo;你们的努力，公司都看得见&rsquo;。&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1757472016407.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">△薛玉良在马六甲景点游玩</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;跟着父亲入行跑了7年</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">看着我跑成单王还带着兄弟们一起赚钱</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">知道我拿奖我爸开心地干了瓶二锅头&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">90后的全职外卖骑手刘天强</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">在京东经历了很多个第一次</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">第一次坐飞机、第一次月入过万、</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">第一次签劳动合同&hellip;&hellip;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">出发前兄弟们都说</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;你放心玩，我们继续努力，</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">争取下次出国的是我们！&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1757472056109.jpg\" /></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #95a5a6; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 14px;\">△刘天强工作中和双子塔前自拍照</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">&ldquo;干得漂亮、活得精彩&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">一线楷模的旅程还在继续</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">他们还将一起去感受婆罗洲文化</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">去看最美日落、去出海&hellip;&hellip;</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">和伙伴们一起创造、经历</span></p>\n<p style=\"line-height: 1.5; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000; font-family: 微软雅黑; font-size: 16px;\">更多的&ldquo;人生第一次&rdquo;</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>", "contentAbstract": "", "contentCode": "content02925", "contentTitle": "这些一线楷模，出国了！", "contentType": 2, "createTime": 1757471167000, "id": 6591, "isDelete": 0, "link": "", "linkType": 0, "projectName": "京东物流官网", "srcUrl": "/vendor/jdl-cms-pro.s3-cache-accelerate.cn-north-1.jdcloud-oss.com/image-1757472088037.jpg", "updateTime": 1757472285000}}